WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:03.992
Hi, I'm Irfan Fahmi. I enjoy building things, figuring out

00:00:03.992 --> 00:00:07.817
why they break, and getting them working.

00:00:08.667 --> 00:00:13.142
Take SMC Crows. I work on Android compatibility, device testing,

00:00:13.142 --> 00:00:17.617
and the release portal. That means helping people install the

00:00:17.617 --> 00:00:22.092
game, update it, and keep their accounts safe.

00:00:22.967 --> 00:00:28.167
The portal has recorded over twenty-seven thousand Android download requests

00:00:28.167 --> 00:00:33.367
across releases. These include retries, so they aren't unique players.

00:00:33.367 --> 00:00:38.567
The latest Windows installer has over six hundred downloads.

00:00:39.433 --> 00:00:43.325
I've also built a vision-based self-checkout system and a gesture

00:00:43.325 --> 00:00:47.217
controller for touchless reading. I connect models to interfaces people

00:00:47.217 --> 00:00:51.108
can actually use.

00:00:51.967 --> 00:00:56.254
I like owning the whole problem: investigate, build, test on

00:00:56.254 --> 00:01:00.542
real hardware, then explain the setup and the limits.

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.592
I'm looking for an engineering role where I can contribute

00:01:04.592 --> 00:01:07.783
and keep learning. Explore my work at irfan fahmi dot

00:01:07.783 --> 00:01:10.975
com. Let's talk.
